# Keep secrets, dev junk, and build cruft out of the web image.
# Path semantics: docker-compose `build.context: .` is the MONOREPO ROOT,
# but the .dockerignore is resolved relative to the Dockerfile under
# BuildKit when no top-level .dockerignore exists. To stay safe we mirror
# patterns under apps/web and rely on the api/.dockerignore for global
# exclusions when building from root.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
*.spec.ts
*.spec.tsx
**/__tests__/**
tests
tests/e2e
playwright-report
test-results
coverage
.nyc_output
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.gitignore
.planning
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
*.log
*.md
